{'symbol': 'SBUX', 'date': '2023-06-21 09:41:00', 'title': 'STARBUCKS TO OPEN SUSTAINABILITY LEARNING AND INNOVATION LAB IN COSTA RICA', 'text': "SEATTLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STARBUCKS ANNOUNCED PLANS TODAY TO DEVELOP A NEW SUSTAINABILITY LEARNING AND INNOVATION LAB AT HACIENDA ALSACIA – THE COMPANY'S GLOBAL AGRONOMY HEADQUARTERS FOR RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT, LOCATED IN COSTA RICA. THE LAB WILL SERVE AS A HUB FOR HANDS-ON AND VIRTUAL LEARNING OPPORTUNITIES FOR STARBUCKS PARTNERS (EMPLOYEES), STUDENTS, RESEARCHERS AND INDUSTRY LEADERS TO INNOVATE AND SCALE SUSTAINABLE SOLUTIONS FOR SOME OF THE WORLD'S MOST CHALLENGING ENVIRONMENTAL AND SOCIA."}